
@startuml
title Figure 3 — Windowing, overlap, hop

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #222222
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam NoteBorderColor #BBBBBB
scale 0.9

participant "Acquisition Manager" as AM

== Window 1 ==
activate AM
note over AM
Window duration = win_s (seconds)
end note
deactivate AM

... hop_s = win_s * (1 - overlap) ...

== Window 2 ==
activate AM
note over AM
Window duration = win_s (seconds)
end note
deactivate AM

note over AM
Example: win_s = 5 s, overlap = 0.8 -> hop_s = 1.0 s
end note
@enduml
